                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Filisti nibakamvwa kuti Davida wananikwa mafuta aabwami bwa-Israyeli, ba-Filisti boonse bakeza kuzooyandaula Davida, Mpawo Davida naakamvwa, wakainka kuyoobalwisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mak 11:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela ba-Filisti kabazide kukusaala mukuti lya-Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davida wakabuzya kuli-Leza kuti, Sa njiinke kuyoolwisya ba-Filisti? Sa uyoobaaba mumaanza aangu? Nkabela Jehova wakamwaambila kuti, Ee, koya, njoobaaba mumaanza aako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakainka ku-Baalaperezimu, nkabela Davida wakabazunda nkukooko, Elyo Davida wakati, Leza wasorokela basinkondoma kuma an za aangu mbubonya mbwaakasotoka maanzi. Nciceeco oko kuntu ncikwakaulikilwa izma lya-Baalaperazimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakasiya zikozyano zyamizimu yabo nkukonya oko, nkabela Davida wakalailila kuti itentwe mumulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
